    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Cultural Ambassadors</strong></p><p><strong>“A smile is a blade if you know where to put it.”</strong></p><p>Cultural Ambassadors weaponize hospitality. They learn your customs, flatter your saints, and find the one story you tell yourself to stay brave. Then they use it to open doors—or to make you open them.</p><p><em>You’re learning the shape of your shadow. Expect mistakes. Budget for them.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Performance and Diplomacy.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Soft Power OPs.</li></ul>",
